{"nbformat":4,"nbformat_minor":0,"metadata":{"colab":{"provenance":[],"mount_file_id":"12MAXyZ2KqFfVZtrkymXHdTh4MEmy7DVZ","authorship_tag":"ABX9TyO4ZWxkNdgcBkSPVIlb4VoG"},"kernelspec":{"name":"python3","display_name":"Python 3"},"language_info":{"name":"python"}},"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["**Estimasi Parameter Sektor ODTW — Provinsi DIY**\n","\n","Menghitung tiga parameter yang saling terkait:\n","  1. Laju Penutupan Dasar ODTW (d)              [1/Tahun]\n","  2. Sensitivitas ODTW terhadap Investasi (s)   [Unit/(Miliar Rupiah*Tahun)]\n","  3. Laju Pembangunan ODTW Non Investasi (N)    [Unit/Tahun]\n","\n","Struktur model:\n","  Laju Pembangunan ODTW = Investasi * s + N\n","  Laju Penutupan ODTW   = Jumlah ODTW * d\n","\n","Metode:\n","1. Teori populasi stabil: porsi umur > T = exp(-(d+g)T)          (Preston dkk., 2001)\n","2. Identitas stock-flow: Sum Pembangunan = Sum dODTW + d * Sum ODTW(t-1)  (Sterman, 2000)\n","3. Pembagian jalur menurut pengelola ODTW (Statistik ODTW 2024, BPS): swasta -> jalur investasi (BKPM); pemerintah + masyarakat -> jalur non-investasi\n","\n","Cara pakai:\n","    pip install openpyxl --break-system-packages   (jika belum ada)\n","    python hitung_parameter_odtw.py"],"metadata":{"id":"YD52skrvW3au"}},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":6,"metadata":{"id":"K_aYt4jpVKQQ","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1789564888804,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":125,"user":{"displayName":"Kevin Atha Fathoni Ramadha","userId":"09413341038730317114"}}},"outputs":[],"source":["import math\n","from pathlib import Path"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["1. INPUT"],"metadata":{"id":"NzrwDpnkXJgH"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["FILE_MASTER = \"/content/drive/MyDrive/Skripsi_Citra/Parameter ODTW/[FIX] Master Data.xlsx\"\n","SHEET = \"Data Tahunan\"\n","BARIS_ODTW = \"Jumlah Objek Daya Tarik Wisata\"\n","BARIS_INVESTASI = \"Investasi Sektor Pariwisata\"\n","TAHUN_AWAL, TAHUN_AKHIR = 2015, 2025\n","\n","# Statistik ODTW 2024 (BPS) — Provinsi DI Yogyakarta, persen\n","DISTRIBUSI_UMUR = {\"< 1\": 2.70, \"1-5\": 23.85, \"6-10\": 27.85, \"11-20\": 20.62, \"> 20\": 24.98}\n","PENGELOLA = {\n","    \"Pemerintah Pusat\": 6.98,\n","    \"Pemerintah Daerah\": 13.20,\n","    \"Otorita/UPT\": 0.00,\n","    \"BUMDes\": 3.61,\n","    \"Pokdarwis\": 9.30,\n","    \"Swasta\": 57.09,\n","    \"Komunitas/Lainnya\": 9.82,\n","}\n","JALUR_INVESTASI = [\"Swasta\"]  # sesuai cakupan data BKPM (PMA + PMDN)"],"metadata":{"id":"wyOCIAQ3XLBf","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1789564889895,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":2,"user":{"displayName":"Kevin Atha Fathoni Ramadha","userId":"09413341038730317114"}}},"execution_count":7,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":[" 2. BACA DATA"],"metadata":{"id":"GSHy-btLXQVw"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["def baca_seri(path):\n","    try:\n","        import openpyxl\n","        if not Path(path).exists():\n","            raise FileNotFoundError(path)\n","        ws = openpyxl.load_workbook(path, data_only=True)[SHEET]\n","    except Exception as e:\n","        print(f\"Excel tidak terbaca ({e}) -> memakai nilai manual.\")\n","        return ODTW_MANUAL, INVESTASI_MANUAL\n","\n","    kolom = {}\n","    for c in range(1, ws.max_column + 1):\n","        v = str(ws.cell(1, c).value).strip()\n","        if v.isdigit():\n","            kolom[int(v)] = c\n","    tahun = range(TAHUN_AWAL, TAHUN_AKHIR + 1)\n","\n","    def ambil(nama):\n","        for r in range(1, ws.max_row + 1):\n","            if str(ws.cell(r, 2).value).strip() == nama:\n","                return [float(ws.cell(r, kolom[t]).value) for t in tahun]\n","        raise ValueError(f\"Baris '{nama}' tidak ditemukan\")\n","\n","    print(f\"Data dibaca dari '{path}'.\")\n","    return ambil(BARIS_ODTW), ambil(BARIS_INVESTASI)"],"metadata":{"id":"VPF9AE4zXQ2W","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1789564891949,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":4,"user":{"displayName":"Kevin Atha Fathoni Ramadha","userId":"09413341038730317114"}}},"execution_count":8,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["3. PERHITUNGAN"],"metadata":{"id":"q4_uRpjGXTP-"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["def laju_penutupan(odtw, batas=(5, 10, 20)):\n","    n = len(odtw) - 1\n","    g = (odtw[-1] / odtw[0]) ** (1 / n) - 1\n","    nilai = list(DISTRIBUSI_UMUR.values())\n","    idx = {5: 2, 10: 3, 20: 4}\n","    lam = [-math.log(sum(nilai[idx[T]:]) / 100) / T for T in batas]\n","    return g, lam, sum(lam) / len(lam) - g\n","\n","\n","def main():\n","    odtw, inv = baca_seri(FILE_MASTER)\n","    assert abs(sum(DISTRIBUSI_UMUR.values()) - 100) < 0.1\n","    assert abs(sum(PENGELOLA.values()) - 100) < 0.1\n","\n","    # --- (1) Laju Penutupan Dasar ODTW\n","    g, lam, d = laju_penutupan(odtw)\n","    print(\"\\n=== 1. LAJU PENUTUPAN DASAR ODTW ===\")\n","    print(f\"g (pertumbuhan ODTW {TAHUN_AWAL}-{TAHUN_AKHIR}) = {g:.4f}\")\n","    for T, l in zip((5, 10, 20), lam):\n","        print(f\"   batas {T:>2} tahun -> d + g = {l:.4f}\")\n","    print(f\"d = {sum(lam) / 3:.4f} - {g:.4f} = {d:.4f} per tahun (umur rata-rata {1 / d:.1f} tahun)\")\n","\n","    # --- (2) Total pembangunan ODTW dari identitas stock-flow\n","    delta = odtw[-1] - odtw[0]\n","    sum_odtw_prev = sum(odtw[:-1])\n","    total = delta + d * sum_odtw_prev\n","    print(\"\\n=== 2. TOTAL PEMBANGUNAN ODTW 2016-2025 ===\")\n","    print(f\"Sum dODTW              = {delta:.2f} unit\")\n","    print(f\"d x Sum ODTW 2015-2024 = {d:.4f} x {sum_odtw_prev:.0f} = {d * sum_odtw_prev:.2f} unit\")\n","    print(f\"Sum Pembangunan        = {total:.2f} unit\")\n","\n","    # --- (3) Pembagian jalur\n","    porsi_inv = sum(PENGELOLA[k] for k in JALUR_INVESTASI) / 100\n","    porsi_non = 1 - porsi_inv\n","    sum_inv = sum(inv[1:])\n","    n_tahun = len(odtw) - 1\n","    s = porsi_inv * total / sum_inv\n","    N = porsi_non * total / n_tahun\n","    print(\"\\n=== 3. PEMBAGIAN JALUR (porsi pengelola ODTW DIY) ===\")\n","    print(f\"Porsi jalur investasi (swasta)          = {porsi_inv:.4f}\")\n","    print(f\"Porsi jalur non-investasi (pem. + masy.) = {porsi_non:.4f}\")\n","    print(f\"\\nSensitivitas ODTW terhadap Investasi = {porsi_inv:.4f} x {total:.2f} / {sum_inv:.2f}\")\n","    print(f\"                                     = {s:.5f} unit/(miliar Rp x tahun)\")\n","    print(f\"Laju Pembangunan ODTW Non Investasi  = {porsi_non:.4f} x {total:.2f} / {n_tahun}\")\n","    print(f\"                                     = {N:.3f} unit/tahun\")\n","\n","    # --- (4) Cek kewajaran\n","    print(\"\\n=== 4. CEK KEWAJARAN (rata-rata periode) ===\")\n","    rata_inv = sum_inv / n_tahun\n","    bangun = s * rata_inv + N\n","    tutup = d * sum_odtw_prev / n_tahun\n","    print(f\"Rata-rata investasi {rata_inv:.1f} miliar -> ODTW swasta {s * rata_inv:.2f} + non-investasi {N:.2f}\")\n","    print(f\"Pembangunan {bangun:.2f} - penutupan {tutup:.2f} = neto {bangun - tutup:.2f} unit/tahun\")\n","    print(f\"Data: neto rata-rata = {delta / n_tahun:.2f} unit/tahun  (harus sama)\")\n","\n","    print(\"\\n=== Rumus Excel (Data Tahunan) ===\")\n","    print(\"O51 (d) : =AVERAGE(-LN(0.7345)/5,-LN(0.456)/10,-LN(0.2498)/20)-((O8/E8)^(1/10)-1)\")\n","    print(\"O49 (s) : =(0.5709*((O8-E8)+O51*SUM(E8:N8)))/SUM(F33:O33)\")\n","    print(\"O50 (N) : =(0.4291*((O8-E8)+O51*SUM(E8:N8)))/10\")\n","\n","\n","if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n","    main()"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"bEEO62igXVJF","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1789564896206,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":2064,"user":{"displayName":"Kevin Atha Fathoni Ramadha","userId":"09413341038730317114"}},"outputId":"da4c1bb1-28a9-4df1-a78e-d1cb94c62c42"},"execution_count":9,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Data dibaca dari '/content/drive/MyDrive/Skripsi_Citra/Parameter ODTW/[FIX] Master Data.xlsx'.\n","\n","=== 1. LAJU PENUTUPAN DASAR ODTW ===\n","g (pertumbuhan ODTW 2015-2025) = 0.0199\n","   batas  5 tahun -> d + g = 0.0617\n","   batas 10 tahun -> d + g = 0.0785\n","   batas 20 tahun -> d + g = 0.0694\n","d = 0.0699 - 0.0199 = 0.0499 per tahun (umur rata-rata 20.0 tahun)\n","\n","=== 2. TOTAL PEMBANGUNAN ODTW 2016-2025 ===\n","Sum dODTW              = 36.00 unit\n","d x Sum ODTW 2015-2024 = 0.0499 x 1812 = 90.48 unit\n","Sum Pembangunan        = 126.48 unit\n","\n","=== 3. PEMBAGIAN JALUR (porsi pengelola ODTW DIY) ===\n","Porsi jalur investasi (swasta)          = 0.5709\n","Porsi jalur non-investasi (pem. + masy.) = 0.4291\n","\n","Sensitivitas ODTW terhadap Investasi = 0.5709 x 126.48 / 6864.59\n","                                     = 0.01052 unit/(miliar Rp x tahun)\n","Laju Pembangunan ODTW Non Investasi  = 0.4291 x 126.48 / 10\n","                                     = 5.427 unit/tahun\n","\n","=== 4. CEK KEWAJARAN (rata-rata periode) ===\n","Rata-rata investasi 686.5 miliar -> ODTW swasta 7.22 + non-investasi 5.43\n","Pembangunan 12.65 - penutupan 9.05 = neto 3.60 unit/tahun\n","Data: neto rata-rata = 3.60 unit/tahun  (harus sama)\n","\n","=== Rumus Excel (Data Tahunan) ===\n","O51 (d) : =AVERAGE(-LN(0.7345)/5,-LN(0.456)/10,-LN(0.2498)/20)-((O8/E8)^(1/10)-1)\n","O49 (s) : =(0.5709*((O8-E8)+O51*SUM(E8:N8)))/SUM(F33:O33)\n","O50 (N) : =(0.4291*((O8-E8)+O51*SUM(E8:N8)))/10\n"]}]}]}